00:15:47.159 --> 00:15:49.960
your director, your virtual production supervisor

318
00:15:50.799 --> 00:15:52.120
can look at these monitors on stage

319
00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:57.120
and know exactly which machine is rendering what.

320
00:15:58.039 --> 00:16:01.840
And you can see an entire amalgamation

321
00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:04.799
of all of these video signals on one monitor.

322
00:16:04.799 --> 00:16:07.070
Really helpful and handy.

323
00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:10.750
This is an example of what the Barco will do for you.

